{
  "file_id": "3553",
  "text_count": 188,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������So, princess, where should we go?",
      "_offset": 969,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Ugh! Don't call me \"princess\"!",
      "_offset": 1011,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I was joking! Joking!",
      "_offset": 1042,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Heeeeeeeeeey!",
      "_offset": 1064,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "It's Yamato!",
      "_offset": 1078,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Have you seen Sora?",
      "_offset": 1091,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "No, we haven't been able to find\nher.",
      "_offset": 1111,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Really? I wonder where she went.",
      "_offset": 1149,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I...saw Sora.",
      "_offset": 1182,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Huh? Where'd you see her?",
      "_offset": 1196,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "At the Gekomon castle. I thought\nit might have been a dream, but...",
      "_offset": 1222,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I have a feeling...the voice that\ntold me not to eat the mushrooms\nwas also Sora's.",
      "_offset": 1290,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 1374,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "But why isn't Sora showing herself\nto us?",
      "_offset": 1382,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Worrying about it won't solve\nanything. We have to find her in\nthe flesh first.",
      "_offset": 1424,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Heeeeey! Soraaaaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 1504,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Soraaaaaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 1526,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "What's going on?",
      "_offset": 1543,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I hear something.",
      "_offset": 1560,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Huh? Maybe it's Sora.",
      "_offset": 1578,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "It's a Flymon!",
      "_offset": 1600,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Not good! Flymon are real fast!",
      "_offset": 1615,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Birdramon! She saved us!",
      "_offset": 1647,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "If Birdramon is here, then so is\nSora!",
      "_offset": 1672,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "She's there! Over there!",
      "_offset": 1711,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Soraaaaaa! Wait for us!",
      "_offset": 1736,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Soraaaaaa! Wait for us!",
      "_offset": 1760,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Wait, Sora!",
      "_offset": 1784,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Why are you running away?!",
      "_offset": 1796,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Sora, do you hate us?",
      "_offset": 1823,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "No...I don't.",
      "_offset": 1845,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Sora, go ahead. Tell them.",
      "_offset": 1859,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "The night Piyomon and I left to\nlook for Taichi, I saw them.",
      "_offset": 1886,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "PicoDevimon was talking to\nsomeone.",
      "_offset": 1947,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "What were they talking about?",
      "_offset": 1983,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Everyone's Crests have a meaning.\nFor example, Taichi has the Crest\nof Courage...",
      "_offset": 2013,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "The Crest of Courage...",
      "_offset": 2095,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Yamato has the Crest of\nFriendship.",
      "_offset": 2119,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Friendship...",
      "_offset": 2155,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "What about me?",
      "_offset": 2169,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "You have the Crest of Hope.",
      "_offset": 2184,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "The Crest of Hope...Huh.",
      "_offset": 2212,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Koushirou has the Crest of\nKnowledge, Jou has the Crest of\nHonesty...",
      "_offset": 2237,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Mimi has the Crest of Purity, and\nI...have the Crest of Love.",
      "_offset": 2307,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Huh. The Crest of Love suits you,\nSora.",
      "_offset": 2369,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "No, it doesn't! It doesn't suit me\nat all!",
      "_offset": 2409,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "But Sora, you're always worrying\nabout us...",
      "_offset": 2452,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I don't care about everyone! You\ndon't know what I'm *really* like!",
      "_offset": 2497,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "I'm sorry...",
      "_offset": 2569,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "W-what's wrong?",
      "_offset": 2582,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "My Crest will never glow.",
      "_offset": 2598,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 2624,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Because I don't have any love.",
      "_offset": 2629,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What do you mean, you don't have\nany love?",
      "_offset": 2660,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "PicoDevimon said that I was raised\nwithout any real love...",
      "_offset": 2703,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "He said, because of that, my Crest\nwill never glow!",
      "_offset": 2763,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Don't be silly. PicoDevimon was\njust lying.",
      "_offset": 2815,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "It's not a lie. When I was on the\ngirls' soccer team...",
      "_offset": 2859,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I was injured, but no matter how\nmuch I asked, my mother wouldn't \nlet me go to an important match.",
      "_offset": 2915,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "She only sees me as the daughter\nof a flower arrangement school\nhead.",
      "_offset": 3019,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "What's that? A school head?",
      "_offset": 3089,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "A hereditary teacher of flower\narrangement.",
      "_offset": 3117,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "So if I grew up without love, I\ncan't do anything about that!",
      "_offset": 3161,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "But even if that's true, you can't\njust believe everything\nPicoDevimon says!",
      "_offset": 3223,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "W-waaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3300,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "H-hey, Yamato. What am I supposed\nto do at a time like this?",
      "_offset": 3319,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "If she wants to cry, let her cry.",
      "_offset": 3380,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Yamato's such an adult.",
      "_offset": 3414,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Well, more than Taichi, anyway.",
      "_offset": 3438,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Thank you, Sora. You were secretly\nhelping us, weren't you?",
      "_offset": 3470,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "She knew PicoDevimon was up to\nsomething, so she decided to help\nyou in secret.",
      "_offset": 3530,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I didn't know.",
      "_offset": 3610,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "I...like having you around, Sora.",
      "_offset": 3625,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 3659,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 3664,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "So, don't leave us anymore. I\ndon't want my family...",
      "_offset": 3669,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I mean, I don't want everyone to\nsplit up.",
      "_offset": 3723,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Takeru... Okay, I understand.",
      "_offset": 3766,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Things have calmed down a bit.",
      "_offset": 3796,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "You're our friend no matter what",
      "_offset": 3827,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Your Crest will surely glow someday",
      "_offset": 3860,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Even if your Crest doesn't glow,\nSora, you're still our friend.",
      "_offset": 3896,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Thanks, but then how are we gonna\nsave the world?",
      "_offset": 3960,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "We'll all think of a way.",
      "_offset": 4010,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Yeah. I understand.",
      "_offset": 4036,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Your Crest will glow someday,\nSora. I'm sure of it.",
      "_offset": 4056,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Haha! It's weird for you to say\nthings like \"I'm sure of it\".",
      "_offset": 4108,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "My intuition's always right on the\nmark, you know.",
      "_offset": 4170,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "I get the feeling your Crest will\nglow, too.",
      "_offset": 4221,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 4266,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Thanks, guys.",
      "_offset": 4274,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Sora's been deep in thought over\nthere.",
      "_offset": 4288,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Yeah, she's dealing with a lot of\nstuff.",
      "_offset": 4328,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Sora will cheer up.",
      "_offset": 4369,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Yeah! She's just a bit tired.",
      "_offset": 4389,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Thank you for earlier, Takeru!",
      "_offset": 4419,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "What do you mean?",
      "_offset": 4450,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "For convincing Sora.",
      "_offset": 4468,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Your words cheered her up, Takeru!",
      "_offset": 4489,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Yeah! I think so, too!",
      "_offset": 4524,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "I just said what I was thinking.",
      "_offset": 4547,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "That's good.",
      "_offset": 4580,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I have to do something impressive\nbefore Lord Vamdemon gets here!",
      "_offset": 4593,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Sora! Watch out!",
      "_offset": 4659,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 4676,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Gh!",
      "_offset": 4685,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Piyomon! Hang in there, Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 4689,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "I'll...protect Sora...",
      "_offset": 4722,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Mm, what's going on?",
      "_offset": 4745,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Aaaaah! PicoDevimon!",
      "_offset": 4766,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Uh-oh!",
      "_offset": 4787,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "W-what?!",
      "_offset": 4794,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Chosen Children...",
      "_offset": 4806,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "PicoDevimon was talking to this\nguy!",
      "_offset": 4825,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "He's not \"this guy\"! He's Lord\nVamdemon!",
      "_offset": 4862,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Vamdemon...",
      "_offset": 4903,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Hahaha. Your journey ends here!",
      "_offset": 4915,
